<title>SINGAPORE: Kian Ho says sued by Indonesian firm.</title>
<headline>Kian Ho says sued by Indonesian firm.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's Kian Ho Bearings Ltd said on Thursday it was being sued by Indonesian firm PT Sinar Surya Corp over the alleged supply of unsatisfactory goods.</p>
<p>Kian Ho said in a statement it was counter-claiming for defamation.</p>
<p>The Singapore company said it was being sued for damages, interests and costs &quot;arising from the alleged supply of non-genuine goods and for alleged negligent misstatement and/or fraudulent misrepresentation on or around 1991-1992&quot;.</p>
<p>It said Kian Ho director Kwek Che Chuan was also being sued over the same allegations.</p>
